{"4126990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cassandra's Show", "steam_appid": 4126990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/f9463e5043031fd21aa6a22664c1ce84.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1220 height=290 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/791108911c119a3a530b832c94cdabc7.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/1810fe7d517efefe367f6451c6d86f26.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1222 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re filming a children’s show with Bunny, Raccoon, and Ducky — making fun and educational videos about how to behave.  But something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, your friends stop moving.<br>The friendly voice of the director turns cold and tells you to go to sleep.<br>The curtain opens… and behind it is your bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e315e59fea6bb235ee96c63d682b5eaf.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/54f08ef461e3c80defbb142d4b89755a.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/54f08ef461e3c80defbb142d4b89755a.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/9ce1192d6069dce6f2f4b90004f6faaf.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1223 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each show is a chance to earn an item — and every item is a piece of the key that will open the way to freedom.<br>Complete all the challenges during the day, so at night, while no one’s watching, you can finally try to escape the studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/b291e84da538f0374afbd46123f3ee6d.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/f23619101f6d12e10a7e72709fe0a720.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/f23619101f6d12e10a7e72709fe0a720.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/59fc3fc78bb393043a2813636d30bbfa.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1221 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness can hide you from the Director’s eyes, but it won’t protect you from the others hiding there.<br>In the shadows live Cassandra’s fans — and they’re ready to take her for themselves at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/8869bffc11882e56581c8950595eb46e.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1200 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e2db53648b96c70527bf913ef9a9b551.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e2db53648b96c70527bf913ef9a9b551.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/442a57fabf032b22c9f53f3b3449732a.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1221 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll see all of Cassandra’s thoughts at once. <br>Some will guide you — others will lead you astray. <br>Can you keep up with everything that goes through the mind of someone slowly losing her sanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎥 <strong>30 Days to Film 7 Episodes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 30-day cycle where you must correctly complete all 7 episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode has unique filming tasks and required actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many mistakes reset your progress — and waste valuable days.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌑 <strong>Light &amp; Shadow Survival</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light during the day to avoid unwanted attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in the darkness at night to evade the Director’s Eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage lighting, control noise, and navigate through safe paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💭 <strong>Mind Maze Sequences</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streams of Cassandra’s thoughts with both correct and misleading options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right thought to complete an episode or obtain a key piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong choices alter events and make escape more difficult.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎬 <strong>Performance-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks focused on timing, reaction, and action sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions made during filming affect the flow of the show and character behavior.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful children’s show that slowly descends into a surreal nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover why you’re here and who your co-workers on set really are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the studio within <strong>seven days</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/791108911c119a3a530b832c94cdabc7.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/1810fe7d517efefe367f6451c6d86f26.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1222 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re filming a children’s show with Bunny, Raccoon, and Ducky — making fun and educational videos about how to behave.  But something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lights go out, your friends stop moving.<br>The friendly voice of the director turns cold and tells you to go to sleep.<br>The curtain opens… and behind it is your bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e315e59fea6bb235ee96c63d682b5eaf.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/54f08ef461e3c80defbb142d4b89755a.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/54f08ef461e3c80defbb142d4b89755a.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/9ce1192d6069dce6f2f4b90004f6faaf.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1223 height=462 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each show is a chance to earn an item — and every item is a piece of the key that will open the way to freedom.<br>Complete all the challenges during the day, so at night, while no one’s watching, you can finally try to escape the studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/b291e84da538f0374afbd46123f3ee6d.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1200 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/f23619101f6d12e10a7e72709fe0a720.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/f23619101f6d12e10a7e72709fe0a720.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/59fc3fc78bb393043a2813636d30bbfa.avif?t=1768217854\" alt=\"\"width=1221 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness can hide you from the Director’s eyes, but it won’t protect you from the others hiding there.<br>In the shadows live Cassandra’s fans — and they’re ready to take her for themselves at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/8869bffc11882e56581c8950595eb46e.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1200 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e2db53648b96c70527bf913ef9a9b551.poster.avif?t=1768217854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/e2db53648b96c70527bf913ef9a9b551.mp4?t=1768217854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/extras/442a57fabf032b22c9f53f3b3449732a.avif?t=1768217854\" width=1221 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll see all of Cassandra’s thoughts at once. <br>Some will guide you — others will lead you astray. <br>Can you keep up with everything that goes through the mind of someone slowly losing her sanity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎥 <strong>30 Days to Film 7 Episodes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 30-day cycle where you must correctly complete all 7 episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode has unique filming tasks and required actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many mistakes reset your progress — and waste valuable days.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌑 <strong>Light &amp; Shadow Survival</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the light during the day to avoid unwanted attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in the darkness at night to evade the Director’s Eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage lighting, control noise, and navigate through safe paths.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💭 <strong>Mind Maze Sequences</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streams of Cassandra’s thoughts with both correct and misleading options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right thought to complete an episode or obtain a key piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrong choices alter events and make escape more difficult.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎬 <strong>Performance-Based Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasks focused on timing, reaction, and action sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions made during filming affect the flow of the show and character behavior.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>Psychological Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful children’s show that slowly descends into a surreal nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover why you’re here and who your co-workers on set really are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the studio within <strong>seven days</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "She never wanted the spotlight. Now she’s trapped in a twisted children’s show — on a stage run by a mad director. You have 30 days to save her.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/f8e23c2f29eb94b3a1f2ba22235f3923b3185f5a/header.jpg?t=1768217854", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/cb9cc01d03bfe52c0e3469ffe85ec1f534ba9bb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768217854", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126990/cb9cc01d03bfe52c0e3469ffe85ec1f534ba9bb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768217854", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 590, 6 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600, 6 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_re